sequenceDiagram
  actor Visitor
  participant CF as Cloudflare SaaS
  participant API as Eventos77 Worker
  participant DB as D1
  participant R2 as Public R2
  Visitor->>CF: GET www.festival-cliente.example
  CF->>API: Host request after edge TLS
  API->>DB: lookup exact active host mapping
  alt unknown host or status not ready
    DB-->>API: missing/pending
    API-->>Visitor: 404 or 421, no tenant default
  else active verified mapping
    DB-->>API: organization A / edition 2027
    API->>DB: check org active and published snapshot
    DB-->>API: published content only
    API->>R2: approved asset keys
    R2-->>API: images / metadata
    API-->>Visitor: SSR page + canonical + public headers
  end
